WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:05.360
The east had smoke rising early while the west.

00:05.440 --> 00:10.920
Only started cooking at dusk this shows the supervision troops should have returned to the western camp.

00:11.000 --> 00:16.440
These past few days the Wuzhao only sent Xuan people to die mainly to exhaust our arrows.

00:17.480 --> 00:22.920
And demoralize our troops those supervising should not be the main force so the enemy's main force.

00:23.000 --> 00:28.880
Should be in the east tonight raid the western camp.

00:29.280 --> 00:34.080
Brother-in-law I ask to lead the cavalry out of the city they are all brothers who have followed me.

00:34.160 --> 00:37.640
Since I joined the army each willing to fight to the death.

